{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1970eb16fd856bb9c3dc35207ae2126f814518341eb499e6e83924a3cd0a4196", "ja": "（次の公演では、美希にセンターとして立ってもらう\nことにした。さて、美希はどこに……）", "zh": "（确定下次公演要由美希担任Center了。\n好了，美希人在哪呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4454b5a07980acebf7993e4d907f8cd8d4e23163497dfe39b0ebb74f648c060d", "ja": "ねえねえ、美希ちゃん～。お買い物にいったら、\nわたしの服選んでくださいねっ！", "zh": "欸欸，美希～等等去逛街，\n要麻烦你帮我挑一下衣服哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "d5d7d447bacedd6ea7dc57ad600fd5753e47eca7914a54167c3c67fc317a65e1", "ja": "あ、ワタシのもお願い！\nミキのコーデって、カッコよくていいよネ♪", "zh": "啊，我也要！\n美希配的穿搭，都很帅气呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "ad2dd797a6e28385c352375ab97b6284f0ca2307fc0ea3e2ee86d98f4e5e8db9", "ja": "む～。ミキ、お買い物はあとでって言ったのに～。", "zh": "唔～美希明明就说逛街是待会儿的事情了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1004_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b85d932ff8bfed8b4b3e1634dbf127013775ab510571872ce3452779a2c83cde", "ja": "あ、美希、ここにいたんだな。\nちょうどよかった。ちょっと話が……。", "zh": "啊，美希，你在这啊。\n我正好有事要找你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "6d3852cc89360de389e665adf6673358fb30e10b723b1aa3db483515c9411303", "ja": "ミキも、ちょうどよかったの。\n翼とエレナが、ミキのジャマするんだよ。ヒドイよね？", "zh": "美希也觉得你来得正好，翼和艾琳娜\n一直打扰美希睡觉，你说她们过不过份？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "eea7393955cf72cd1b1b50f2852dd8b356770c13e872dde506fe710642460b43", "ja": "え～、ジャマしてませんよ～。\nお出かけの準備だもーん。", "zh": "咦～哪有～\n我们只是在做出门的准备嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "01a361541cfef52b3aecfa7a333476d9d23a519cb30c455b82b017186921c180", "ja": "そうだ、{$P$}も一緒に行こうヨ♪\n今日はお天気もいいから、きっと楽しいヨ！", "zh": "对了，{$P$}也一起去吧♪\n今天天气很好，一定会很好玩的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "d08cd8b86701520351f9bdd42a6479bbb8c084aaeab8c49fe4bb237136a8a765", "ja": "{$P$}も行くの？　なら、\nお出かけが先でもいいかな……。決まりなの！", "zh": "{$P$}也要去吗？那么，\n先出门好像也不错……就这么决定了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1010_p", "source_sha256": "da69c20d0da18632e77f0ac84ec158d4d313f3966dff2aa5143224c92d8e36ed", "ja": "いや、決める前に話を……", "zh": "等等，先让我把话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "56bd3d3ae960fd6cd166a7e048e9d708f5260c87512af2482b07235f5c545bee", "ja": "あ、いたいた♪　聞いたよ、美希！\n次の公演、楽しみにしてるねっ！", "zh": "啊，人在这♪美希，我听说啰！\n下次的公演，我很期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "d337aada22b949dd3dcab5adac997462051bdfca8319ed3b3852726f3408ac2f", "ja": "私も、今からとっても楽しみで……。\nきっと、素敵な公演になるんだろうな、って……♪", "zh": "我也是，从现在就非常期待……\n我想一定会是场很精彩的公演……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "4770406fd9cebe9d9226073b5f0078b49d194a72886ad6553821717eed7ef5ce", "ja": "公演……？\n次の公演がどうかしたの？", "zh": "公演……？\n下次的公演怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0158a1995719f8dfcaad8379b6621d51197cd0e2125cfeb012991a5790585a18", "ja": "あ～っ！　もしかして、次は美希ちゃんの\nセンタ―公演ってことですか？", "zh": "啊～！难不成，\n下次是美希的Center公演是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "60aaa7c1247092bb78ec8d1b370391d2536ca8140216298601975bc6191b2482", "ja": "あれ？　……あっ、もしかして私、フライングしちゃい\nました！？　わああっ、ごめんなさい～！", "zh": "咦？啊……我是不是走漏风声了！？\n哇啊啊！对不起～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1016_p", "source_sha256": "18cc06c66e5620342c21f96f172c68d64d231b763263cfd92a9aa6b3616cbc11", "ja": "いや、買い物に連れていかれそうになってたから、\n助かったよ……。てことで、美希。", "zh": "没事的，我差点就要被带去逛街，\n你刚好救了我……所以说，美希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d6ac31c7d231c5c042aa47bd4064bdd39c4144f53344400e6ccbb7bebd7664bd", "ja": "改めてだけど、次の公演のセンター……この劇場の\nセンター公演を頼みたいんだ。やってくれるか？", "zh": "我要郑重问你，下次公演的Center……我想将这个剧场的\nCenter公演交给你，你愿意接下这个任务吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "fc42d0bb05d4ab6f6aea3cf5d06e2cbe1c395b897b55beadc0e85d127eeb7289", "ja": "うん、いいよ。\nミキ、がんばるね☆", "zh": "嗯，好啊。\n美希会加油的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1019_p", "source_sha256": "fb4274c4cb8c6f00689d4c7744cac84d3a09952cb8820e3b5bacb35f671cb476", "ja": "……そ、そうか。思ったよりあっさりした\n返事だったけど、まあいい。期待してるぞ！", "zh": "……这、这样啊，回答得比想像中还要干脆呢。\n不过也好，我很看好你的表现喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f502de876c8645d5d4983297727e90f896c41f75d384d3d9ec2d85adc299dc41", "ja": "ついに美希ちゃんのセンター公演かぁ。\n楽しみ～♪　わたし、ぜったい観に来ますね！", "zh": "终于要换美希Center公演了啊。\n好期待哦～♪我一定会来看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "f786609e35374f3fcfac5b7833ef372247593d05f69bcfcee28a3ede8564df56", "ja": "{$P$}、ワタシも公演に出ちゃダメ？\nミキとのステージはいつも、すっごく楽しいんだヨー！", "zh": "{$P$}，能让我也一起参加公演吗？\n每次跟美希演出时，都超好玩的呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a731eabbe5b475eda1b25e1e66a502b6013f85b09fb4b5b9aab8737e9dbd64e5", "ja": "あ、わたしも！　メンバーに立候補しまーす！\nいいですよね、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "啊，我也要！我要报名当成员～！\n可以吧，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1023_p", "source_sha256": "b77f1829b73e3738d8679fc9ea09bcf7432a60ae75f1cddafaae4b5d7c792d18", "ja": "いいんじゃないかな。二人なら美希にもしっかり\nついていけるだろうし……。どうだ、美希？", "zh": "可以啊，你们俩应该也跟得上美希……\n美希，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1024_003mik", "source_sha256": "6b9f6b63e2c7a43892c1e3e7e6ddfeb3edc08c7f532eaf476ee60993949fbab9", "ja": "うんっ。翼とエレナなら、\nミキもいい感じにできるって思うな♪", "zh": "嗯！如果是翼和艾琳娜，\n美希也觉得会有不错的演出♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c964c06ed716d8a00a479926d5aeafb651bed5dca93e6d0100dc1fdd47f102ea", "ja": "わぁ、美希ちゃんホント！？　じゃあ決まりですねっ！\nえへへ、わたし、本気でがんばっちゃお～っと！", "zh": "哇，美希你说真的吗！？那就这么决定了！\n嘿嘿，我要拿出真本事加油了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "152391e9f878c49ba3f4d810584fbafd1a707161cab1835f17354a8089ad28f8", "ja": "美希、困ったことがあったらいつでも言ってね。\n私も出来るだけ手伝うから♪", "zh": "美希，如果有烦恼，随时都能跟我说喔。\n我也会尽量帮忙的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1027_045kar", "source_sha256": "8f56675e29efde5ff86fa08363144ecf83fefc0b8a5dbc36fdd6711649e3ebe9", "ja": "わ、私にも、お手伝いさせてね。\nも、もちろん、美希ちゃんさえよければだけど……。", "zh": "我、我也是，请让我帮忙吧。\n当、当然，前提是美希你不介意的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1028_003mik", "source_sha256": "de084c102747078bc699ec2b2d3fdfcd8b29014bd68da5bf18ad33f685c66937", "ja": "もちろんなの！\n春香も可憐も、頼りにしてるね。あはっ☆", "zh": "当然不介意！春香和可怜，\n到时候也要请你们帮忙了，啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "f520d1741105c5ebc8edce3dd89347395cb4dd6ffd43668bd61e1ffddb36cf6b", "ja": "よーし！　みんなで力を合わせて、美希のセンター\n公演を盛り上げようね！　765プロ～！", "zh": "好～！大家一起合力炒热\n美希Center公演的气氛吧！765艺能～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1037_001har", "source_sha256": "6699dc3673c94cc5d7d130d2bf1d883c8b139a9cba92b6f03f3c136d2c382ab2", "ja": "ファイト～、オ～！", "zh": "加油～喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1032_018ele", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1033_p", "source_sha256": "e906a337700b61dbfe388689c3d6ede5aaf6fbc91e500a5668f9e6d45de5bee1", "ja": "（みんな盛り上がってるな。美希もちゃんとやる気に\nなってくれたみたいだし、この調子なら……）", "zh": "（大家都很起劲呢。美希好像也很有\n干劲的样子，照这样一定……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1034_se", "source_sha256": "b12709ece634544d32af67a926a9d0555729b694be2ce9963a7d8ef771034632", "ja": "プルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1035_p", "source_sha256": "05a0fea61bc03b62cebd5a71218a4bce91f21910d34b755cef142480aa8c3080", "ja": "ん？　電話が……誰からだ？\nはい、765プロですが……。", "zh": "嗯？有电话……是谁打来的？\n您好，这里是765艺能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_045_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_045_1036_p", "source_sha256": "7c3cc390c14fa368e0b013b23b75ff1c24e998eacccf4849f43ec08dab2c7b6b", "ja": "えっ。美希を？", "zh": "什么？指定美希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
